{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":15,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["猶大的災難"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對我說：「就算摩西和撒母耳站在我面前求情，我也不會憐憫這些百姓。你把他們從我面前趕走，讓他們離開吧！"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["如果他們問你，『我們該去哪裡，』你就告訴他們，耶和華這樣說，",{"text":"「『該死的死，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"該被殺的被殺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"該遭饑荒的遭饑荒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"該被擄的被擄。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["「我要讓他們遭受四種禍患——刀殺、狗撕、鳥啄、獸吞。這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["因為希西迦的兒子猶大王瑪拿西在耶路撒冷的所作所為，我要使他們的遭遇令天下萬國驚懼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"「耶路撒冷啊，誰會同情你？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰會為你悲哀？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰會駐足向你問安？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你棄絕我，背離我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我要伸手攻擊你，毀滅你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我已厭倦施憐憫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在這片土地上的各城門口用簸箕簸散我的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們喪掉兒女；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要滅絕他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們不思悔改。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使他們的寡婦比海沙還多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使毀滅者在午間攻擊青年的母親，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓她們突然陷入痛苦和驚恐。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"生過七個孩子的母親心力枯竭，奄奄一息。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她的太陽在白晝已經墜落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必蒙羞受辱。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使其餘的人喪身在敵人刀下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶利米訴苦"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["母親啊，我真不幸，因為你生了我這個跟全猶大爭論、激辯的人。我沒有向人借貸，也沒有借貸給人，然而人人都咒罵我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和華說：「我必拯救你，使你受益。我必使仇敵在災禍、困難來臨時哀求你。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["誰能折斷來自北方之敵的鐵拳銅臂呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["因為你們境內罪惡氾濫，我要使敵人任意搶掠你們的財寶，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["把你們擄到陌生的地方。我的怒火已被點燃，要燒滅你們。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，你知道我的遭遇。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你顧念我，眷顧我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"報應迫害我的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你不要取走我的性命，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你不輕易發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你知道我為了你忍受辱罵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之上帝耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我得到你的話便吃了下去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的話是我心中的快樂和喜悅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我屬於你的名下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我沒有與作樂的人為伍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有與他們同樂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我獨坐一處，因為你的手按在我身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你使我義憤填膺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼我的痛楚無休無止？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼我的創傷無法治癒？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道你要像一條時斷時流的小溪一樣靠不住嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"因此，耶和華對我說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「如果你回心轉意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我就讓你重新事奉我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你若說有益的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不說無益的話，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就可以做我的發言人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓便會歸向你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你不可歸向他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使你在這些百姓面前成為堅固的銅牆。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要攻擊你，卻不能勝過你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我與你同在，我會搭救你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救你。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把你從惡人手中救出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從殘暴之徒的權勢下贖回。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/15.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/16.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/14.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}